NOTE - the formal witnessed measurement (preflight + 1 s CPU busy sample + the full tests/test_npu_inference.py
suite incl. the 500-frame stability/latency test) could not be run in this session: the NPU stopped creating
hardware contexts after two timed-out experimental dispatches and needs a device restart. This log is the
bring-up evidence; the acceptance latency target (glass-to-glass <= 8.0 ms) is NOT met by the committed
schedule (18.3 ms NPU dispatch + ~4.5 ms input staging + ~1.5 ms head readback on this container).
